sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Startup / local wake tick
  participant M as MAR owner reconciliation
  participant P as PostgreSQL owner + queue projection
  participant X as Worker
  W->>M: reconcile current Release/config/freshness
  M->>P: atomically admit at most one immediate logical occurrence
  P-->>M: committed or fail closed
  P->>X: private queue mechanics
  X->>M: guarded owner-state transition

